  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Trigger</strong> You Cast a Spell.</p><hr><p class=\"MsoNormal\">After channeling your magic, you take some of its residual energies to create a barrier through a card in your hand. You Play a Card as you cast the triggering spell. For 1 round, you gain resistance to physical damage equal to the rank of the spell, and a +1 status bonus to a saving throw depending on the suit of the card Played:</p></div><ul><li><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\"> <strong>Strength/Constitution</strong>: Fortitude</p></li><li><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\"><strong>Dexterity/Intelligence</strong>: Reflex</p></li><li><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\"><strong>Wisdom/Charisma</strong>: Will</p></li></ul>"
